                    "ask_2": "\"...I'm hungry.\" I'm hungry. Very hungry.\n\nSuddenly, you realize that something has appeared in your pocket. A piece of cheese. You do not remember where it came from.",
                    "give_cheese_1": "You offer the cheese. The Rat King immediately snatches it, smells it once, and eats it all.",
                    "give_cheese_2": "It chews very slowly.\n\n\"Good cheese.\"",
                    "give_cheese_3": "You look at it. \"...What about this place?\" The Rat King looks at you for a moment. \"I don't know.\"",
                    "give_cheese_4": "You begin to feel as though you have just been tricked. It turns away and continues licking the remaining cheese from its claws. You have no idea what you are supposed to do next.",
                    "keep_cheese_1": "You keep the cheese. The Rat King looks at it.\n\nThen it looks at you.",
                    "keep_cheese_2": "\"...I'm hungry.\"\n\nYou repeat your original question.\n\nThe Rat King turns away.\n\n\"I'm hungry.\"",
                    "keep_cheese_3": "You try asking again. It does not answer.\n\nIt seems this conversation will not continue unless you are willing to pay... in cheese.",
                    "identity_1": "You ask what it really is.\n\nThe Rat King raises its head. For the first time, its expression becomes serious.\n\n\"You want to know who I am?\"",
                    "identity_2": "It stands on the rock. \"I am the ruler of every living creature beneath this earth. Hundreds of years ago, my name made even the strongest creatures tremble. I devoured those who dared enter my territory, crushed those who opposed me, and—\"",
                    "identity_3": "It continues.\n\nAnd continues.\n\nYou begin to wonder how long this rat has been preparing its speech.",
                    "identity_4": "\"...I am the embodiment of darkness, the greatest demon ever—\"\n\nIts voice suddenly becomes strangely high and clear.\n\n\"—to appear upon this world!\"",
                    "identity_5": "You remain silent. The Rat King keeps its grand pose. The only problem is that its current voice does not fit the image it just created. It clears its throat and tries to return to its old voice.\n\n\"...Ahem. As I was saying.\"\n\nYou say nothing. The Rat King seems not to notice the problem.",
                    "attack_1": "You draw your weapon.\n\nThe Rat King looks at you.\n\n\"...Huh?\"\n\nYou charge.",
                    "attack_2": "But just before your attack reaches it, the Rat King disappears from the rock. You stop short. A squeal comes from behind you. Then another.",
                    "attack_3": "Hundreds of rats begin rushing toward you from every direction. You try to fight back, but there are simply too many. They bite, scratch, and cling to your arms and legs, giving you no chance to escape the tunnel.",
                    "attack_4": "You keep fighting.\n\nRat corpses pile up around you.\n\nBut eventually your body can take no more. You collapse.",
                    "bad_end_1": "[BAD END — Don't attack the Rat King.]",
                    "bad_end_2": "Seriously, pick on something easier next time.",
                },
            },
